    4. Place components one at a time on the grid. For each, pick a random anchor
       and check that all cells are empty (GREY) and no cell is 4-adjacent to an
       existing black cell (8-adjacent is allowed). Place largest first for easier
       packing. Retry placement if constraint violated.
    5. All placed cells become BLACK. The output is derived by recoloring each
